{"version":1,"content":"<p>上午8時50分，天文台錄得26.2°C，相對濕度77%。</p><p>高空反氣旋正為廣東帶來大致良好的天氣。</p><p>本港地區今日（30日）天氣預測天晴。</p><p>日間乾燥，市區最高氣溫約30°C，新界再高一兩度，吹輕微至和緩偏東風。</p><p>展望明日（31日）日間大致天晴及乾燥。</p><p>（天文台）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T02:00:38.275593+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T01:08:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:39:42.392622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T01:58:11.494546+00:00","content_hash":"630f76edc853b180505632bc9b06a6cdd3d35aa3c7841b34d969e386078d9503","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}